							<div class="col-sm-9">

								

									

									

										<div class="overflow-when-no-wrap item-control-static">
											
												
												

													Development of shipping application (e-Chartering) using ASP.NET core and entity framework for shipping industry

												
											



											
								(EL)
							
										</div>
									

								

									

									

										<div class="overflow-when-no-wrap item-control-static">
											
												
												

